cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use or reference this experiment, please cite it using the metadata
  in this file.
type: software
title: >
  plateau-mago-implicit: Implicit 3D Tiles from Project PLATEAU CityGML
  using Mago 3DTiler
abstract: >
  Also known as PLATEAU Kai, applying the latest open-source technology to
  Hokkaido PLATEAU data toward faster display. A small, rigorous, reproducible
  technical experiment testing whether building data from Project PLATEAU
  CityGML for Muroran City (室蘭市), Sarabetsu Village (更別村), and Sapporo
  City (札幌市) can be converted into Implicit 3D Tiles using Mago 3DTiler
  in a deterministic and reproducible manner, and consumed comfortably with
  CesiumJS from ordinary static HTTP storage. Presented in the working style
  of UN Open GIS Initiative DWG7.
repository-code: https://github.com/dwg7/plateau-mago-implicit
